ient funds\"\n},\n{\n\"step\": \"2. Attempt to place order\"\n}\n],\n\"expected_result\": \"Insufficient funds message is displayed.\",\n\"priority\": \"High\",\n\"test_type\": \"Negative\"\n}, {\n\"id\": \"test_order_placed_with_invoicing_failure_insufficient_funds\",\n\"requirement\": \"The customer cannot place an order with invoicing if the invoice exceeds the maximum allowed amount and the customer has insufficient funds in their account during checkout.\",\n\"title\": \"Invoicing failure due to insufficient funds during checkout\",\n\"preconditions\": \"Customer has logged in and is on the cart page with at least one product, then proceeds to checkout with invoicing option available but exceeding the maximum allowed amount and having insufficient funds in their account\",\n\"steps\": [\n{\n\"step\": \"1. Select invoicing\"\n},\n{\n\"step\": \"2. Verify that invoicing fails due to insufficient funds\"\n}\n],\n\"expected_result\": \"Invoicing fails message is displayed.\",\n\"priority\": \"High\",\n\"test_type\": \"Negative\"\n}, {\n\"id\": \"test_order_placed_with_discount_code_failure\",\n\"requirement\": \"The customer cannot place an order with a discount code during checkout if the code is invalid or has expired.\",\n\"title\": \"Discount code failure during checkout\",\n\"preconditions\": \"Customer has logged in and is on the cart page with at least one product, then proceeds to checkout with valid but expired or invalid discount code available\",\n\"steps\": [\n{\n\"step\": \"1. Enter discount code\"\n},\n{\n\"step\": \"2. Verify that order fails due to invalid or expired discount code\"\n}\n],\n\"expected_result\": \"Discount code fails message is displayed.\",\n\"priority\": \"High\",\n\"test_type\": \"Negative\"\n}, {\n\"id\": \"test_order_placed_with_multiple_discounts_available_failure\",\n\"requirement\": \"The customer cannot place an order with multiple discounts available during checkout if the total exceeds the maximum allowed amount.\",\n\"title\": \"Multiple discounts available failure during checkout\",\n\"preconditions\": \"Customer has logged in and is on the cart page with at least one product, then proceeds to checkout with multiple discounts available but exceeding the maximum allowed amount\",\n\"steps\": [\n{\n\"step\": \"1. Select multiple discounts\"\n},\n{\n\"step\": \"2. Verify that order fails due to exceeding maximum allowed amount\"\n}\n],\n\"expected_result\": \"Order fails message is displayed.\",\n\"priority\": \"High\",\n\"test_type\": \"Negative\"\n}, {\n\"id\": \"test_order_placed_with_no_discounts_available_failure\",\n\"requirement\": \"The customer cannot place an order with no discounts available during checkout if the total exceeds the maximum allowed amount.\",\n\"title\": \"No discounts available failure during checkout\",\n\"preconditions\": \"Customer has logged in and is on the cart page with at least one product, then proceeds to checkout without any discounts available but exceeding the maximum allowed amount\",\n\"steps\": [\n{\n\"step\": \"1. Verify that no discounts are available\"\n},\n{\n\"step\": \"2. Attempt to place order\"\n}\n],\n\"expected_result\": \"Order fails message is displayed.\",\n\"priority\": \"High\",\n\"test_type\": \"Negative\"\n}"